          ]
        },
        "long_description": {
          "before": "o11 is the AI data warehouse for financial firms. The largest firms build a moat around their data. Today, they pay engineers $200k a year each to spend years organizing/maintaining disconnected sources in a legacy data warehouse. The business intelligence that results is the key unlock, but it's time effort and money that would be better spent elsewhere.\r\n\r\no11 brings a custom ontology and data model to firms of any size allowing them to unify CRM, email, files, data rooms, market data, M365, etc. all in one place. We help firms architect their own data warehouse, and then from their AI maintains it. No engineers, no legacy solutions, no complex migration. o11 is built for security and complex permissions from the ground up allowing it to safely connect directly into any agent including Claude, ChatGPT, and Copilot.\r\n\r\nLeverage your proprietary data -- it's the deal, relationship, and business intelligence that makes your firm special",
          "after": "o11 is the AI account manager for consumer and self-serve applications, helping teams treat every customer like a flagship client. It brings email and iMessage conversations together, suggests personal replies, and turns customer signals into timely follow-ups. Teams can tailor each persona’s voice and review response plans before turning them on."
        },
